{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_09_end",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_09",
  "title": "0:01A.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-9",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8ee38c868c4854aa51d0729db219a4d4d8ebb5c0637500e3f015878632a91e8f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "0:38 P.M.    天气/沙尘\n龙门市区，广场，露天派对"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "虽然我们跟着指示过来了，但为什么......是个露天派对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "看到那个蜡烛了没！好大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "能天使，安静一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "空气里甜味太重了，稍微有点不舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#3",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "嗯......要是下次在这里申请一个摊位的话，应该会大赚的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "德克萨斯，老板有消息吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "暂时没有，也许他就在哪里酩酊大醉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......能天使，把我头上的东西摘下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "为什么嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "我可是因为这盏日光灯，根本没有办法戴这种高高的派对帽喔？我很羡慕的喔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "那如果强行戴上会怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "就像是宿醉醒来的时候发现自己在德克萨斯的副驾驶上高歌猛进的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "......那真是不得了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你还真的这么试过啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "所以，老板在哪儿呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "这里人太多了，如果敌人追到了这里，会把普通人都卷进去的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "......是你们，企鹅物流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我记得你是......那个侦探所的打工妹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "旁边这位就是传闻中一人一刀走码头的分舵主？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "不是，呃，怎么还有这么夸张的版本......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "我只是个普通的小商贩，啊，今晚还兼职鱼丸师傅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "你就是德克萨斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "今天晚上发生的事情，你们可别说自己不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "槐琥，用不着这么咄咄逼人的，她们应该也只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "我知道。但是这种事件发生的次数实在是多到幽默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "如果不把其他人卷进去也就罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "殃及无辜，让平民蒙受财产损失，你们自己就没有作为合法公民的自觉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（好像完全无法反驳！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "所以，有必要纠正你们的劣根性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "用、用不着直接拉开拳架吧，我们也知道今晚给大家添了很多麻烦，但是有话好好说嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "德克萨斯！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "话说在前头，今晚的事情，对我而言，同样莫名其妙，而且，很累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "所以我现在的心情实在不怎么好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "你明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "一对一，我赢了，你们接下来就得乖乖遵纪守法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "......至少一个月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（一个月就够了！？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我赢了，就让你们那些成天不务正业的家伙多管好自己的工作，少管闲事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "这说的倒是没错......但是，我是不会手下留情的！准备好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "唉，怎么就变成这样了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "等等！都冷静一下！再怎么说，在市中心打架斗殴也有点太——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好功夫，打得好！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "狼小姐也不要输啊！打！小心背后！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久没见过这么漂亮的炎国功夫了！多耍几招啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "这不是表演啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "德克萨斯！加油！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "小心脚下！是佯攻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "你们也不要跟着起哄啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "汽水，你们要吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#2",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "啊！谢谢。但是你不打算稍微劝个架吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "阻止不了，看样子也知道吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......我们就这么看着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "不然加加油也可以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*杂音*——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂——！所有参加安魂夜派对的好市民们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搞什么，那个家伙是怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听得见吗~？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，你很吵欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不错不错，看来听得见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么现在，请静一静！静一静！谢谢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "广播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然后竖起耳朵，膜拜我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那、那家伙怎么回事！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，他是大帝！喂，是塞壬的说唱之神！快来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他不是应该在哥伦比亚吗！？怎么会在龙门？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......大帝先生，在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "老板总自诩是音乐人嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "实际上也是喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "咱们的资金来源当然不光是物流业务本身，老板的资金渠道非常复杂。还有——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "还有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#4",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "不，还是算了。感觉说太多会很不妙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "怎么了，动作变慢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......人流的动向太整齐了，情况不对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "别想找借口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大帝！大帝！大帝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大帝！大帝！大帝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真吵啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天是安魂节，大帝先生，你的噪音连死人都能吵醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "什——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "你是，什么时候......在我身后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晚安，大帝先生，安魂节快乐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": "char_105_emper",
      "operatorId": "char_105_emper",
      "portraitKey": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "......臭老鼠，你给我......记住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，怎么了？这是什么演出——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大帝？大帝被刺穿了？死了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "喝啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": "char_243_waaifu_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_243_waaifu",
      "portraitKey": "char_243_waaifu",
      "text": "哼嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孑",
      "speakerToken": "char_272_strong_1",
      "operatorId": "char_272_strong",
      "portraitKey": "char_272_strong",
      "text": "哎？槐琥，你打错人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "不。她没做错什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "被包围的是我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒客？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_033",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "呃......难道说，该不会，从贫民窟一直追到了这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "这里，这么多人，都是他们的同伙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "不会吧，这个人数......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "基本全都是敌人，这是个陷阱，大帝先生他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "——！?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个话筒该怎么用......咳咳，喂？各位龙门市民，晚上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请各位不要慌张，刚才死掉的只是一只微不足道的企鹅，安魂夜庆典不会停止。自然，会有专人来处理这具麻烦的尸体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然事出突然，深感歉意，不过是时候为今晚的狂欢增添一项临时项目了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的叙拉古朋友为我们带来了一份特别大礼，现在藏在这场露天派对的某个地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "时间不多，朋友们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "（他在看着我？不，等等，那个老人是——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果没有人找到这份宝藏，很遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那将是你们人生中最后的惊喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
